  "prefLabel": "Fire 101.17 Hiring authority",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fire 101.17 “Hiring authority” means any legally designated official(s) of a private, incorporated, or unincorporated entity or body politic that authorizes the appointment of fire service personnel.\n\nSource (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Fire 100) #12225-A, eff 6-28-17",
